	<Worksheet ss:Name="메타정보">	
	<Table>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">< 통계표 메타자료 ></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">○통계표ID</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">DT_1IN1503</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">○통계표명</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">연령 및 성별 인구 ? 읍면동</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">○수록기간</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">null</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">○출처</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">KOSIS(「인구총조사」, 국가데이터처), 2026.09.14 16:24 </Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">○문의처</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">042-481-3757 </Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">○통계표URL</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">https://kosis.kr/statHtml/statHtml.do?orgId=101&tblId=DT_1IN1503&conn_path=I3</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">* KOSIS 개편 시 통계표 URL은 달라질 수 있음</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">○주석</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">통계표 : 주1) 총인구(외국인 포함)"</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">         "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">         주2) 평균연령 : ∑(특정연령*특정인구수)/총인구"</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">                중위연령 : 총인구를 연령순으로 나열할 때 중앙에 있는 사람의 연령"</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">         "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">         주3) 성비(여자 100명당 남자의 수) : 남자 인구/여자 인구*100"</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">         "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">         주4) 개인정보 보호와 노출 위험성을 최소화하기 위하여 5미만 자료는 X로 표기함"</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">          "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">         주5) 2023년부터 매년 읍면동 단위로 공표 "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">          ※ 끝자리가 0, 5년인 해(2015, 2020)는 읍면동, 그 외 연도(2016~2019, 2021, 2022)는 시군구 단위 공표"</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">         "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">         "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">         --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------"</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">         "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">         ※ 2025년 주요변경사항"</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">         "</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">           ㅇ 시군구→읍면동 확대 공표 : 6개 통계표"</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">             - 인구, 가구 및 주택 ? 읍면동(연도 끝자리 0, 5), 시군구(그 외 연도)"</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">             - 현 거주지 성, 연령 및 1년 전 거주지 기준 이동자유형별 인구(1세이상) - 읍면동(연도 끝자리 0, 5), 시군구(그 외 연도)"</Data>	
	</Cell>	
	</Row>	
	<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="12">	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String"></Data>	
	</Cell>	
	<Cell> 	
	<Data ss:Type="String">             - 현 거주지, 성 및 1년 전 거주지 기준 이동자유형별 인구(1세이상) - 읍면동(연도 끝자리 0, 5), 시군구(그 외 연도)"</Data>	
